{"id":"passwords","title":"Most common passwords","prompt":"Name the 10 most common passwords (NordPass 2025)","noun":"passwords","category":"Oddball","metric":"Accounts using it (NordPass 2025)","source":{"name":"Wikipedia: List of the most common passwords","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_the_most_common_passwords","asOf":"2026-11-02","dataAsOf":"2025"},"answers":[{"rank":1,"name":"123456","aliases":[],"value":"21,627,656","n":21627656,"article":"123456","fact":{"text":"It topped SplashData's list every year from 2013 to 2019; in 2016 it alone was 4% of the passwords studied.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_the_most_common_passwords"}},{"rank":2,"name":"admin","aliases":[],"value":"21,030,012","n":21030012,"article":"admin","fact":{"text":"Devices often ship with defaults like admin, and malware such as Mirai scours the internet for ones still using them.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Default_password"}},{"rank":3,"name":"12345678","aliases":[],"value":"8,274,408","n":8274408,"article":"12345678","fact":{"text":"It's exactly eight characters, the typical minimum length; US NIST guidance now asks for at least 15.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Password_policy"}},{"rank":4,"name":"123456789","aliases":[],"value":"5,673,712","n":5673712,"article":"123456789","fact":{"text":"Research on PINs found that more than 35% of people who need a nine-digit PIN pick 123456789.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Personal_identification_number"}},{"rank":5,"name":"12345","aliases":[],"value":"3,950,777","n":3950777,"article":"12345","fact":{"text":"It's also a real ZIP code, used only by a General Electric plant in Schenectady, New York.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/12345"}},{"rank":6,"name":"password","aliases":[],"value":"3,545,119","n":3545119,"article":"password","fact":{"text":"MIT's CTSS was the first computer to ask for one, in 1961, switching off its printer so you could type it in private.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Password"}},{"rank":7,"name":"Aa123456","aliases":[],"value":"2,520,728","n":2520728,"article":"Aa123456","fact":{"text":"It's built to pass mixed-case-plus-digit rules, which the US standards body NIST told sites to drop in 2017.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Password_policy"}},{"rank":8,"name":"1234567890","aliases":[],"value":"1,418,939","n":1418939,"article":"1234567890","fact":{"text":"It's just the keyboard's number row, and row runs like this and qwerty can be tested automatically at high speed.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Password_strength"}},{"rank":9,"name":"Pass@123","aliases":[],"value":"1,210,039","n":1210039,"article":"Pass@123","fact":{"text":"Swapping in symbols barely slows crackers: the admin password taken in the DigiNotar hack was reportedly Pr0d@dm1n.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Password_strength"}},{"rank":10,"name":"admin123","aliases":[],"value":"1,087,247","n":1087247,"article":"admin123","fact":{"text":"Four of NordPass's top 20 are built on admin: admin, admin123, admintelecom and Admin@123.","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_the_most_common_passwords"}}],"extras":[{"rank":11,"name":"1234567","aliases":[],"value":"1,084,354","n":1084354},{"rank":12,"name":"123123","aliases":[],"value":"1,060,563","n":1060563},{"rank":13,"name":"111111","aliases":[],"value":"990,391","n":990391},{"rank":14,"name":"12345678910","aliases":[],"value":"988,396","n":988396},{"rank":15,"name":"P@ssw0rd","aliases":[],"value":"770,658","n":770658},{"rank":16,"name":"Aa@123456","aliases":[],"value":"735,141","n":735141},{"rank":17,"name":"admintelecom","aliases":[],"value":"585,620","n":585620},{"rank":18,"name":"Admin@123","aliases":[],"value":"579,512","n":579512},{"rank":19,"name":"112233","aliases":[],"value":"576,908","n":576908},{"rank":0,"name":"qwerty123","aliases":[],"value":"#5 in 2026 (Huntress)"},{"rank":0,"name":"qwerty1","aliases":[],"value":"#6 in 2026 (Huntress)"},{"rank":